1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,695
The old woman said: do not go when the sky turns brown.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,706
He went. The sea was kind, as it always is at first.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,651
By noon, the horizon had learned his name.

4
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:38,678
He had been warned of its fury. No one had warned him it would be beautiful.

5
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:53,606
At dusk, one lamp on the shore. She did not say a word.
